<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Builds and saves the resources, renaming every referenced file to its fixed path along
the way (unlike :cpp:func:`BaseResEdit::buildResModels`, which only ever appends a
graph id)
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>graph</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The graph for the particular resource </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ctx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The .ini file to build the resource for </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>modName</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The name of the mod to fix to. <bold>Default</bold>: <computeroutput>""</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>resourceFilter</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Which files to build the resource for. <bold>Default</bold>: empty </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>graphId</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The unique id for the graph of the resource. <bold>Default</bold>: <computeroutput>""</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>resModObj</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The mod object used to create the unique id for the resources. <bold>Default</bold>: <computeroutput>nullptr</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
